        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yeah, after thinking more about this, I don't think adding this is a good idea. Aside from from not wanting to add new config options, the main issue is that not all keys which are a reasonable alternative to present ones can be processed. This adds extra points of confusion.\r\n\r\nI guess my suggestion would be to not use 'mini.clue' with triggers that could lead to mappings containing those four non-customizable special keys as their part.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
